<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets warrants on Shanghai Industrial.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Shanghai Industrial.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong Kong Branch, said it is issuing 84.9 million American style call warrants on shares of Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$25.55     PREMIUM	 24.97 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.6380    GEARING	 4.0X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  27.MAR.98    PAYDATE	 2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$25.55</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
